{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a18617ae8c2e0192fa0eedbf0c8a5972.poster.avif?t=1760769599\" width=850 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a18617ae8c2e0192fa0eedbf0c8a5972.webm?t=1760769599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a18617ae8c2e0192fa0eedbf0c8a5972.mp4?t=1760769599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erotis Has Fallen</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of goblins burned cities, wiped out civilizations, and enslaved the survivors. The last bastion of hope is an ancient ritual of elven priestesses that summoned a heroine from another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/4043d39fbb47d39f7cae84ac1141c5be.poster.avif?t=1760769599\" width=850 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/4043d39fbb47d39f7cae84ac1141c5be.webm?t=1760769599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/4043d39fbb47d39f7cae84ac1141c5be.mp4?t=1760769599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Eli, a young woman who died in our world and was resurrected by an ancient deity. To return home, you must cut through goblin armies, master magic, and challenge the Goblin King himself. Each death isn\u2019t the end \u2014 it\u2019s a step toward greater power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a3ff752bc079aa07a745cd78a9b58d39.poster.avif?t=1760769599\" width=850 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a3ff752bc079aa07a745cd78a9b58d39.webm?t=1760769599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/a3ff752bc079aa07a745cd78a9b58d39.mp4?t=1760769599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 unique enemies and 170 variants \u2014 from lesser beasts to twisted abominations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 bosses with unique mechanics that demand real strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 schools of magic and 60+ spells \u2014 build lethal combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression of gear and skills, magic development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ random events and spicy encounters that change your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 collectible cards with explicit illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 atmospheric locations, each with its own style and dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique erotic scenes \u2014 interactive, upgradable, and with X-Ray</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/9211283fb60f682403e13cca5cd20e15.poster.avif?t=1760769599\" width=850 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/9211283fb60f682403e13cca5cd20e15.webm?t=1760769599\" type=\"video/webm